":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/62669860","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/5135#issuecomment-62669860","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/5135","id":62669860,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYyNjY5ODYw","user":{"login":"patrickconroy","id":954577,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NDU3Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/954577?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy","html_url":"https://github.com/patrickconroy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-11-12T04:48:47Z","updated_at":"2014-11-12T04:48:47Z","body":"That makes sense to me it's just that I don't think a behavior should ever expect a record to be there 100% of the time. The association can exist but still not come back if conditions are sent excluding that record for any reason (and perhaps I should have made it known that _any reason_ is the key here), not just the primary key not having a record. So, say if Table2 had a condition set in a finder,\n\n```\n# TranslateBehavior attached in initialize\n\nfunction findPublished(Query $query, $options = []) {\n    $this->where(['Table2.published' => true]);\n    return $query; \n}\n```\n\n and I did `Table1->find()->contain(['Table2' => ['finder' => 'published']])` \n\nTable1.table2_id = 5, Table2 has a record with id=5 but published is false, this would error in that line in the TranslateBehavior.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/62669860/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"patrickconroy","id":954577,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NDU3Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/954577?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy","html_url":"https://github.com/patrickconroy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"actor":{"login":"patrickconroy","id":954577,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NDU3Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/954577?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy","html_url":"https://github.com/patrickconroy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patrickconroy/gists{/gist_i